==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 800,000 and increases by 40,000 with each stage.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~266.67 seconds<sup>500f~8,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mega-Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.
**2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns.
**8 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**8 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**8 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

